WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How are you?
-Oh, I'm great.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:03.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
Happy holidays.
-Happy holidays to you.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:08.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Happy holidays to everybody!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:09.376 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Whoo!

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It must be so fun
to have done three movies

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
with this same
wonderful cast of people.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.316 line:92%
-No, 'cause they're all bitches.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, yeah.
I didn't think of that.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
I didn't think
through my question.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No. No. No.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, we've been
working together on

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
the "Pitch Perfect" movies
for six years now.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.260 size:78% position:39%
And, yeah, it's great
that we're friends

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.461 line:92%
onscreen and offscreen, as well.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.264
-And it must be really nice when
you go and have premieres.

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just did
a premiere in Sydney,

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.234 size:81% position:41%
which must have been
very exciting for you.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:37.170
-Yeah, I think it was basically
just for my family and friends.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:41.541 align:start size:94% position:6%
They demanded that
a premiere happen.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.210 align:start size:94% position:6%
I made that happen for them.
-That's very nice.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They also demanded
an after party.

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is your family
demanded an after party.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:49.916 line:92%
This is your grandmother --

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:51.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
was out promoting
pretty hardcore

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.253 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. She was...

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:56.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's just out at
the local mall.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.857 line:92%
No one told her to do this.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:01:01.661
Like, "The movie studio
makes the money, Grandma,

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:02.629 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
not really me."

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:06.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
But she's out there
in suburban Sydney,

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:08.101 line:92%
like, pumping it, talking me up.

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
She also has
a habit of telling people

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:13.173 line:92%
how much I earn at the movies.

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:15.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I've stopped
telling her things.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:16.276 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's an interesting thing
when you realize

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's not safe
to tell people anymore.

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I'll go home,
and then everyone who works at

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:25.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
the supermarket
or at the butchers,

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:28.455 size:84% position:42%
like, knows how much
I make for every movie.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Not ideal.
-Yeah, not ideal.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The film takes place in
Atlanta and Europe,

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you filmed it
entirely in Atlanta.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:37.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yep, that's right.
-How was Atlanta for you?

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you enjoy it?
-Oh, I loved Atlanta.

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:43.303
I tell you what -- Like, yeah --
Oh, is somebody from Atlanta?

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:47.173
-Barely. Someone sounds like
they're barely from Atlanta.

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:49.275 line:92%
-Or they went there once.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:50.410 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Okay. So, like, in L.A.,

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm probably like
a 6 out of 10, I think.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:56.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
In Atlanta,
I'm like 10 out of 10.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.385 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so popular!
-Wow!

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like, I couldn't
even believe it.

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:06.726
There were these guys --
I was getting gas in my car

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:09.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
during Bella Boot Camp,
which is, like,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.264 line:92%
rehearsal month for the movie.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
And these guys looked like
they were doing, like,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.335 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a little drug deal.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.370 line:92%
So they caught my attention.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.973 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then after
they were finished doing

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:23.243
their little thing,
they came over and asked me out.

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:24.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was a little bit scared.
-Uh-huh.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:30.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I said I had a husband.
I don't, I don't.

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:34.687
And then they asked me,
would I want free drugs anyway?

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:35.555 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow!

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was like,
"When does that happen?"

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.425 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Hardly ever.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:40.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then --
-Yeah.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:41.728 line:92%
-Yeah. There's more story.

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I would get
asked out, like,

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
basically every
single day in Atlanta,

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:48.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
which never happens
to me in real life.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.103 line:92%
And I was just driving my car.

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:52.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
A man rolled down
his window and said,

00:02:52.672 --> 00:02:56.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, I own the
ice-cream store down there.

00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:57.177 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Come with me.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll give you
some free ice cream,

00:02:59.879 --> 00:03:01.814 line:92%
and we can go on a date."

00:03:01.814 --> 00:03:07.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did also say
I have a husband to that guy.

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:07.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But so many times.

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:10.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
In Whole Foods on
Valentine's Day this year,

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.292 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I got bought roses.

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:14.327 line:92%
I was just there buying food,

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a guy bought me
roses in the store.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's amazing.
-I know.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, you will always have
a special place

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.532 line:92%
in your heart for Atlanta.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like I need
to go back there.

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:22.202 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:26.339 size:78% position:39%
-The rest of the year
has been very dry.

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:27.907 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So...yeah.

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:32.512
-You guys -- You had a scene --
Or was it -- An aquarium.

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
You went to an aquarium.
-Yes.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, the "New Bellas,"
which I guess are

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
the younger,
more attractive ones,

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:40.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
perform a sequence
in an aquarium

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:43.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
with real whales
and sharks behind them.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:44.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not an effect.
It's, like, real.

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.759 size:84% position:42%
-And this is real, too.
I'm gonna show a clip.

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:50.296
You guys actually basically
got a sea lion to sing with you.

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:53.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Okay, they were
rescued sea lions.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I know, you know,
there's a bit of

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
controversy about
aquariums and stuff.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.105 line:92%
But they said they were rescued

00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:02.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that they
really wanted to sing with us.

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:04.344 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So, we're like, "Okay."

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:08.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we went down to
the little sea-lion house.

00:04:08.615 --> 00:04:09.315 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it was awesome.

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:12.185 size:78% position:39%
-Here's a clip of you
actually singing with

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:12.852 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
a real sea lion.

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:14.053 line:92%
-I think this is from my phone.

00:04:14.053 --> 00:04:17.457 size:75% position:38% line:92%
On 3. Ready? 1, 2...

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:20.860 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Sea lion roars ]

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.496 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:29.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. It was so much fun.
It was really...Yeah.

